---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Faq from '../components/Faq.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/brand';
import { FAQ, faqSchema as buildFaqSchema } from '../lib/faq';

// One FAQPage block, generated from the FAQ actually rendered on this page, so the
// schema always matches the visible content.
const aboutFaq = [FAQ[0], FAQ[1], FAQ[2], FAQ[3], FAQ[9]];
---

<Base title="The story" path="/about" description="Meet Tati and the story behind her hand sourced natural fiber edit for women and men, with one of a kind pieces made to last." jsonLd={[buildFaqSchema(aboutFaq)]}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-14 pt-8 sm:px-6 md:pb-24">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-wine px-6 py-16 text-cream sm:px-10 md:px-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="absolute -right-32 -top-40 size-[32rem] rounded-full border border-cream/10"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-52 -left-40 size-[36rem] rounded-full border border-cream/10"></div>
      <div class="relative max-w-4xl">
        <p class="text-[0.68rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-blush">A note from Tati</p>
        <h1 class="mt-6 font-display text-5xl leading-[1.04] sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl">
          They do not make them like this anymore.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-cream/85 md:text-lg">
          I built Tati Curated to bring back the feeling of clothing made with real care. Natural fibers, beautiful construction, and one of a kind pieces for women and men.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] md:gap-20 md:py-24">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Why I curate</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl leading-tight text-wine md:text-5xl">
        Better fibers. Fewer compromises.
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-[2rem] bg-blush/55 p-7">
        <p class="font-display text-2xl italic leading-snug text-wine">“{SITE.bioVoice}”</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-[68ch] space-y-7 text-base leading-8 text-ink/80 md:text-lg md:leading-9">
      <p>
        I kept seeing the same problem. So much of the clothing around us is made from polyester and designed to be replaced. I wanted a shop built around the opposite idea. Pieces with substance, character, and a reason to stay in your wardrobe.
      </p>
      <p>
        I source every piece by hand and look first at the fabric. Cotton, linen, wool, and silk. Then I look at the construction, the feel, and the details that make it worth choosing. If I would not want to wear it or see someone I love wear it, it does not make the edit.
      </p>
      <p>
        Tati Curated is for women and men who want more from what they wear. Not more clothing, but better clothing. The kind that feels good in your hands, works hard in your closet, and makes the whole fit click.
      </p>
      <p>
        I add new pieces daily, but I still choose them one at a time. There are no duplicates and no endless restocks. If you find the piece your wardrobe was missing, that one is yours alone.
      </p>
      <a href="/shop" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-wine px-7 text-sm font-bold text-cream transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-wine-deep">
        Shop Tati’s latest finds
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 md:py-20">
    <div class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-wine/10 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="bg-cream p-7 md:p-10">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-wine/80">Hand sourced</p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl text-wine">No duplicates.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/80">Each listing is one real piece, selected for its fabric, quality, and character.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-y border-wine/10 bg-blush/45 p-7 sm:border-x sm:border-y-0 md:p-10">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-wine/80">Natural fibers only</p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl text-wine">Made to last.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/80">Cotton, linen, wool, and silk bring quality back to the everyday wardrobe.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-cream p-7 md:p-10">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-wine/80">For women and men</p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl text-wine">A fit for you.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/80">A warm boutique experience with the same careful eye behind every piece.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Faq
    items={aboutFaq}
    eyebrow="Know the brand"
    title="A little more about Tati Curated."
    intro="The short answers behind the pieces, the process, and where to shop."
  />
</Base>
